<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE task PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Task//EN" "task.dtd">
<task id="git-addon-exclude-files">
  <title>Exclude Files from Version Control</title>
  <shortdesc>Keep generated files, local settings, and other clutter out of Git with a repository
      <filepath>.gitignore</filepath> or a global ignore file.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>ignoring files</indexterm></indexterm>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>.gitignore</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <taskbody>
    <context>
      <p>Ignore rules come in two scopes: a <filepath>.gitignore</filepath> file that lives in the
        repository and is shared with everyone, and a global ignore file that applies to all your
        repositories. Ignore actions are available for untracked files only.</p>
    </context>
    <steps>
      <step>
        <cmd>In the
          <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-unstaged-files"/>
          area, right-click an untracked file or folder and open the
          <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-ignore"/>
          submenu.</cmd>
      </step>
      <step>
        <cmd>Choose what to ignore.</cmd>
        <info>
          <p>
          <dl>
            <dlentry>
              <dt><uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-ignore-file"/></dt>
              <dd>Ignores the selected file.</dd>
            </dlentry>
            <dlentry>
              <dt><uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-ignore-by-extension"/></dt>
              <dd>Ignores every file with the same extension.</dd>
            </dlentry>
            <dlentry>
              <dt><uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-ignore-dir"/></dt>
              <dd>Ignores the selected folder.</dd>
            </dlentry>
            <dlentry>
              <dt><uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-ignore-parent-dir"/></dt>
              <dd>Ignores the folder that contains the selected file.</dd>
            </dlentry>
            <dlentry>
              <dt><uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-ignore-all-files"/></dt>
              <dd>Ignores every file in the selected folder.</dd>
            </dlentry>
          </dl>
          </p>
          <p>Each action adds the matching rule to the repository
              <filepath>.gitignore</filepath>.</p>
        </info>
      </step>
    </steps>
    <result>
      <p>To edit the rules directly, open the
          <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-ellipsis"/>
        menu and choose
          <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-open-gitignore"/>
        or
          <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-open-ignore"/>.</p>
    </result>
  </taskbody>
</task>
